{
  // Skill coverage ratchet baseline, measured on 2026-10-29 with:
  //   `node --import tsx scripts/skill-coverage-gate.ts`
  //
  // Each number is how many public VALUE exports of a package (names exported
  // from src/index.ts and its relative re-exports; types-only exports are not
  // counted) no skill of that package mentions as an identifier inside
  // backticks or a code block. Print the names with `--list [package]`.
  // A package whose count goes UP fails the gate. These numbers may only go
  // DOWN: document the export in a skill, then lower the number here. Never
  // raise one. Every package that ships a skills/ tree and a src/index.ts
  // MUST have an entry.
